    "text": "So? You watched it. Tell me you liked it.",
    "voice_id": "BIvP0GN1cAtSRTxNHnWS",
    "speaker": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "Honestly? No. Not really.",
    "voice_id": "sfJopaWaOtauCD3HKX6Q",
    "speaker": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "Really? Why do you say that?",
    "voice_id": "BIvP0GN1cAtSRTxNHnWS",
    "speaker": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "Um, let me think. It is two hours long, and you know the ending after ten minutes. That is why.",
    "voice_id": "sfJopaWaOtauCD3HKX6Q",
    "speaker": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "OK, but the two of them feel like real people. That is the whole point.",
