    "speaker": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "I mean, the photography is beautiful. I will give you that.",
    "voice_id": "sfJopaWaOtauCD3HKX6Q",
    "speaker": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "So it is not that bad.",
    "voice_id": "BIvP0GN1cAtSRTxNHnWS",
    "speaker": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "It is not bad. It is just slow. What about you? Why do you love it so much?",
    "voice_id": "sfJopaWaOtauCD3HKX6Q",
    "speaker": 1
   },
   {
    "text": "That is a good question. Because nothing happens, I think. And nothing happening is fine sometimes.",
